---
layout: zh-base.njk
title: 博客
ogTitle: 博客 — cerfly
twitterTitle: 博客 — cerfly
description: 记录这个网站和 opencode 一起构建的过程，简短而真实。
nav: blog
enUrl: /blog.html
zhUrl: /zh/blog.html
permalink: /zh/blog.html
---
        <section class="page-content">
            <h1>博客</h1>
            <p class="post-meta">文章目前是英文，中文版后面会陆续补上。</p>
            <div class="blog-posts">
                {%- for post in collections.post | reverse %}
                <article class="post-card">
                    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.zhTitle or post.data.title }}</a></h2>
                    <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | dateZh }} &middot; {{ post.data.zhCategory or post.data.category }}</p>
                    <p>{{ post.data.zhExcerpt or post.data.excerpt }}</p>
                    <p><a class="read-more" href="{{ post.url }}">阅读原文 &rarr;</a></p>
                </article>
                {% endfor -%}
            </div>
        </section>